{
  "$schema": "../schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "country-rw",
  "kind": "country",
  "country": "RW",
  "name": "Rwanda",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "verification": "draft",
  "notes": [
    "The national identification number is 16 digits (World Bank and ID4Africa descriptions, read from the search index); the first digit is 1 for a citizen, 2 for a refugee and 3 for a foreigner. The pack validates the length only. Every other identifier is free text.",
    "The four provinces and the City of Kigali carry ISO 3166-2:RW codes read from a secondary copy of the ISO table (Wikipedia, fetched). No district, sector or cell list is bundled: they are free text.",
    "The holiday list is Presidential Order 54 of 2017, shown on RwandaLII as the latest version (fetched). A secondary site says a 2022 Presidential Order (062/01) repeats the list; that order was not fetched, so whether the 2017 order is still the current text is unconfirmed.",
    "Umuganura is 'the Friday of the first week of August' in the Order, which a date rule cannot state, so its dates are listed by year. The government's holiday page (fetched) lists 1 August 2026, a Saturday, not the first Friday (7 August); the pack follows the page for 2026 and marks the day draft. Other years are the first Friday of August by the Order's wording.",
    "Eid el Fitr and Eid al-Adha are announced each year by the Rwanda Muslim Association (the Order). No announcement was fetched, so no date is listed for any year.",
    "The Order moves a holiday that falls on a weekend to the following working day, except 7 April, and compensates two consecutive weekend holidays in one working day (Article 4). The pack's observed rule covers the Sunday move only; a Saturday holiday is kept on its own day here, and the compensation rules are not modelled.",
    "PAYE and RSSB contributions are due on the 15th of the month after (the Rwanda Revenue Authority pages, fetched). Quarterly PAYE for small taxpayers is not modelled."
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "presidential-order-54-2017",
